NOTES:

Sep 2013:
Work for Siemen's Competition.
Surin's work is under $SVN_ROOT/robotics/surin2011.

But to run it under Corelib, I create a version under $CORELIB/progs/students.

Check out from Surin's directory here:

1) To set up:
	> svnexact

	This will create this export:
		export SVNROOT=https://exact@subversive.cims.nyu.edu/exact

2) Then check out:
	> svn checkout $SVNROOT/robotics/surinAhn2011/ball

	  


